Viktor 11.10.2026: «когда я навожу мышку на волну трека в полноформатном трейлере, выводить спектральный граф полной длиной на весь трек, а тултип с отрезком текста выше. Займёт наверное около 30-40% высоты всей страницы, но это норм. Максимум анализа по волне». heresy-wavescope.js: a quarter second on the full player's wave (the audio rooms, the player in two rows) brings it up on the player's top edge, as wide as the wave's drawing and in time with it, 36 % of the window high; measured once by the lab (heresy-spectrum.js's spectrum, one cache with the take card's; it now gives data, lut and drop). The spectrogram log or linear, the sections, the spectral centroid (magenta), the RMS lane with the take's average, the playhead; under the pointer the time, the moment's own spectrum beside the line with its loudest frequency and note, and up in the picture the frequency, note and level there. A click goes there as on the wave (waveSeek, shared); out of the wave and the scope, or Esc, it goes; a click on the wave before it came only goes there; the switch beside 🔔 turns it off. The card stands over the scope and leaves its slice (1358) to it. The words in the six languages (17 rows). Suite: suite-1374.part (6 checks); kitchen 717/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
